#. module: ssi_school_incident
#: code:addons/ssi_school_incident/models/school_academic_alert.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Context: Create Incident from Academic Alert\n"
"Database ID: %s\n"
"Problem: Creating an Incident is only allowed for Orange or Red alert\n"
"levels\n"
"Solution: Evaluate this alert first (button Evaluate) using an Evaluation\n"
"Context that triggers an Orange/Red Academic Alert Level, then try again\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Konteks: Membuat Insiden dari Peringatan Akademik\n"
"ID Database: %s\n"
"Masalah: Pembuatan Insiden hanya diizinkan untuk tingkat peringatan Oranye atau Merah\n"
"Solusi: Evaluasi peringatan ini terlebih dahulu (tombol Evaluasi) menggunakan Konteks Evaluasi yang memicu Tingkat Peringatan Akademik Oranye/Merah, lalu coba lagi\n"

#. module: ssi_school_incident
#: code:addons/ssi_school_incident/wizards/escalate_incident.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Context: Escalate incident to a higher handling tier\n"
"Database ID: %s\n"
"Problem: Incident '%s' is not allowed to be escalated right now (check\n"
"state/policy)\n"
"Solution: Make sure the incident is Open and that you belong to a group\n"
"allowed by the escalate policy\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Konteks: Eskalasi insiden ke tingkat penanganan yang lebih tinggi\n"
"ID Database: %s\n"
"Masalah: Insiden '%s' saat ini tidak diizinkan untuk dieskalasi (periksa status/kebijakan)\n"
"Solusi: Pastikan insiden berstatus Terbuka dan Anda termasuk dalam grup yang diizinkan oleh kebijakan eskalasi\n"

#. module: ssi_school_incident
#: code:addons/ssi_school_incident/models/school_incident.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Context: Escalate incident to a higher handling tier\n"
"Database ID: %s\n"
"Problem: No escalation criteria selected\n"
"Solution: Select at least one escalation criterion that justifies moving\n"
"this case to the target handling tier\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Konteks: Eskalasi insiden ke tingkat penanganan yang lebih tinggi\n"
"ID Database: %s\n"
"Masalah: Tidak ada kriteria eskalasi yang dipilih\n"
"Solusi: Pilih setidaknya satu kriteria eskalasi yang membenarkan pemindahan kasus ini ke tingkat penanganan tujuan\n"

#. module: ssi_school_incident
#: code:addons/ssi_school_incident/models/school_incident.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Context: Escalate incident to handling tier %s\n"
"Database ID: %s\n"
"Problem: The following escalation criteria do not target this tier:\n"
"%s\n"
"Solution: Deselect the listed criteria, or select only criteria whose\n"
"Target Level matches the tier being escalated to\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Konteks: Eskalasi insiden ke tingkat penanganan %s\n"
"ID Database: %s\n"
"Masalah: Kriteria eskalasi berikut tidak menargetkan tingkat ini:\n"
"%s\n"
"Solusi: Batalkan pilihan kriteria yang tercantum, atau pilih hanya kriteria yang Tingkat Tujuannya sesuai dengan tingkat eskalasi\n"

#. module: ssi_school_incident
#: code:addons/ssi_school_incident/models/school_academic_alert.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Context: Evaluate Academic Alert\n"
"Database ID: %s\n"
"Problem: Evaluation Context could not be evaluated: %s\n"
"Solution: Fix the Evaluation Context so it is valid Python source that\n"
"only assigns local variables, e.g. 'trigger_count = 3'\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Konteks: Evaluasi Peringatan Akademik\n"
"ID Database: %s\n"
"Masalah: Konteks Evaluasi tidak dapat dievaluasi: %s\n"
"Solusi: Perbaiki Konteks Evaluasi agar menjadi kode sumber Python yang valid dan hanya menugaskan variabel lokal, mis. 'trigger_count = 3'\n"

#. module: ssi_school_incident
#: code:addons/ssi_school_incident/models/school_academic_alert.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Context: Evaluate Academic Alert\n"
"Database ID: %s\n"
"Problem: Python Code of Academic Alert Level '%s' could not be evaluated: %s\n"
"Solution: Fix the Python Code of that Academic Alert Level so it sets a\n"
"boolean local variable named 'result'\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Konteks: Evaluasi Peringatan Akademik\n"
"ID Database: %s\n"
"Masalah: Kode Python dari Tingkat Peringatan Akademik '%s' tidak dapat dievaluasi: %s\n"
"Solusi: Perbaiki Kode Python tingkat peringatan tersebut agar menetapkan variabel lokal boolean bernama 'result'\n"

#. module: ssi_school_incident
#: code:addons/ssi_school_incident/models/school_incident.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Context: Set Resolution Status to a Resolved value\n"
"Database ID: %s\n"
"Problem: Resolution Date is empty while Resolution Status is Resolved\n"
"Solution: Fill in the Resolution Date field before saving\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Konteks: Mengatur Status Penyelesaian ke nilai Terselesaikan\n"
"ID Database: %s\n"
"Masalah: Tanggal Penyelesaian kosong sementara Status Penyelesaian adalah Terselesaikan\n"
"Solusi: Isi bidang Tanggal Penyelesaian sebelum menyimpan\n"

