#. module: ssi_school_incident
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_incident.field_school_incident_weekly_review__chk_health_summary_available
msgid "Agenda 6 (v2.0): confirms that a summary of this period's health-related cases (School Incidents whose Incident Type is flagged is_health) has been prepared and reviewed, so health trends are not lost inside the general incident log."
msgstr "Agenda 6 (v2.0): mengonfirmasi bahwa ringkasan kasus terkait kesehatan pada periode ini (Insiden Sekolah yang Jenis Insidennya bertanda is_health) telah disiapkan dan ditinjau, sehingga tren kesehatan tidak hilang di dalam log insiden umum."

