#. module: ssi_school_incident
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_incident.field_school_academic_alert__incident_id
msgid "School Incident created from this alert via the Create Incident button. Only ever set for Orange/Red alerts."
msgstr "Insiden Sekolah yang dibuat dari peringatan ini melalui tombol Buat Insiden. Hanya pernah diisi untuk peringatan Oranye/Merah."

#. module: ssi_school_incident
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_incident.field_school_incident_weekly_review__incident_ids
msgid "School Incident records included in this review. Never editable directly: populated only by the Collect button (action_collect_incidents), which re-runs the Date Start/Date End/School criteria and replaces the whole list. This keeps the review from being coupled to incident management itself -- it only ever reads/references incidents, never creates, edits, or cancels them."
msgstr "Catatan Insiden Sekolah yang disertakan dalam tinjauan ini. Tidak pernah dapat diubah langsung: hanya diisi oleh tombol Kumpulkan (action_collect_incidents), yang menjalankan ulang kriteria Tanggal Mulai/Tanggal Akhir/Sekolah dan mengganti seluruh daftar. Hal ini menjaga agar tinjauan tidak terikat pada pengelolaan insiden itu sendiri -- tinjauan hanya membaca/merujuk insiden, tidak pernah membuat, mengubah, atau membatalkannya."

#. module: ssi_school_incident
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_incident.field_school_incident_weekly_review__school_id
msgid "School/unit this Weekly Case Review is scoped to. Used by the Collect button to only pull in School Incidents whose Student belongs to this School. Leave empty to review all Schools/units together."
msgstr "Sekolah/unit yang menjadi cakupan Tinjauan Kasus Mingguan ini. Digunakan oleh tombol Kumpulkan untuk hanya menarik Insiden Sekolah yang Siswanya termasuk dalam Sekolah ini. Biarkan kosong untuk meninjau semua Sekolah/unit sekaligus."

#. module: ssi_school_incident
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ssi_school_incident.field_school_academic_alert_level__sequence
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ssi_school_incident.field_school_incident_escalation_criteria__sequence
msgid "Sequence"
msgstr "Urutan"

#. module: ssi_school_incident
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:ssi_school_incident.school_academic_alert_level_view_form
msgid "Severity"
msgstr "Tingkat Keparahan"

#. module: ssi_school_incident
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_incident.field_school_academic_alert_level__sequence
msgid "Severity ordering, NOT display ordering: higher value means a MORE severe level, and levels are evaluated from the highest sequence down to the lowest so the most severe rule is always checked first. The first level whose Python Code triggers wins (e.g. Red=30, Orange=20, Yellow=10)."
msgstr "Urutan tingkat keparahan, BUKAN urutan tampilan: nilai yang lebih tinggi berarti tingkat yang LEBIH parah, dan tingkat dievaluasi dari urutan tertinggi ke terendah sehingga aturan paling parah selalu diperiksa lebih dahulu. Tingkat pertama yang Kode Python-nya terpicu akan menang (mis. Merah=30, Oranye=20, Kuning=10)."

#. module: ssi_school_incident
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_incident.field_school_incident_weekly_review__date_start
msgid "Start of the week (or other period) this review covers. School Incidents with an Incident Date on or after this date are eligible to be pulled in by the Collect button."
msgstr "Awal pekan (atau periode lain) yang dicakup tinjauan ini. Insiden Sekolah dengan Tanggal Insiden pada atau setelah tanggal ini dapat ditarik oleh tombol Kumpulkan."

#. module: ssi_school_incident
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_incident.field_school_academic_alert__open_ok
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_incident.field_school_incident__open_ok
msgid ""
"Start policy\n"
"\n"
"* If active user can see and execute 'Start' button"
msgstr ""
"Kebijakan mulai\n"
"\n"
"* Jika aktif, pengguna dapat melihat dan menekan tombol 'Mulai'"

#. module: ssi_school_incident
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ssi_school_incident.field_school_academic_alert__state
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ssi_school_incident.field_school_incident__state
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ssi_school_incident.field_school_incident_weekly_review__state
