msgstr "Catatan Mata Pelajaran"

#. module: ssi_school_incident
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ssi_school_incident.field_school_incident_parent_contact__summary
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "Ringkasan"

#. module: ssi_school_incident
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_incident.field_school_incident_parent_contact__summary
msgid "Summary of what was communicated during this contact. Structure the note using the Empathy -> Facts -> Solution framework from the School Incident & Parent Complaint Handling Guideline: first acknowledge the parent's feelings (Empathy), then state the confirmed facts of the case (Facts), then describe the concrete resolution or next step offered (Solution)."
msgstr "Ringkasan hal yang dikomunikasikan selama kontak ini. Susun catatan menggunakan kerangka Empati -> Fakta -> Solusi dari Panduan Penanganan Insiden & Keluhan Orang Tua Sekolah: pertama akui perasaan orang tua (Empati), lalu sampaikan fakta kasus yang telah dikonfirmasi (Fakta), kemudian jelaskan penyelesaian atau langkah berikutnya yang konkret yang ditawarkan (Solusi)."

#. module: ssi_school_incident
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ssi_school_incident.field_escalate_incident__target_level
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ssi_school_incident.field_school_incident_escalation_criteria__target_level
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:ssi_school_incident.school_incident_escalation_criteria_view_search
msgid "Target Level"
msgstr "Tingkat Tujuan"

#. module: ssi_school_incident
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_incident.field_school_incident__incident_type_id
msgid "The category/type of incident or parent complaint being logged (Master Log column D)."
msgstr "Kategori/jenis insiden atau keluhan orang tua yang dicatat (kolom D Log Induk)."

#. module: ssi_school_incident
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_incident.field_school_incident__contact_method
msgid "The channel used to make first contact with the parties involved in this case (Master Log column I)."
msgstr "Saluran yang digunakan untuk melakukan kontak pertama dengan pihak-pihak yang terlibat dalam kasus ini (kolom I Log Induk)."

#. module: ssi_school_incident
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_incident.field_school_incident_parent_contact__contact_method
msgid "The channel used to make this particular contact."
msgstr "Saluran yang digunakan untuk melakukan kontak ini."

#. module: ssi_school_incident
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_incident.field_school_incident__date_incident
msgid "The date the incident or parent complaint case occurred (Master Log column A)."
msgstr "Tanggal kasus insiden atau keluhan orang tua terjadi (kolom A Log Induk)."

#. module: ssi_school_incident
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_incident.field_school_academic_alert__date_alert
msgid "The date this academic warning check is being performed for the student. Used as the sequence date field when a document number is generated."
msgstr "Tanggal pemeriksaan peringatan akademik ini dilakukan untuk siswa. Digunakan sebagai bidang tanggal urutan saat nomor dokumen dibuat."

#. module: ssi_school_incident
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_incident.field_school_incident__handling_level
msgid "The handling tier currently assigned to this case (Master Log column F). Automatically defaulted from the selected Incident Type, but can still be adjusted per case."
msgstr "Tingkat penanganan yang saat ini ditugaskan untuk kasus ini (kolom F Log Induk). Otomatis diisi default dari Jenis Insiden yang dipilih, tetapi tetap dapat disesuaikan per kasus."

#. module: ssi_school_incident
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_incident.field_escalate_incident__target_level
msgid "The handling tier this case will be escalated to."
msgstr "Tingkat penanganan tujuan eskalasi kasus ini."

#. module: ssi_school_incident
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_incident.field_escalate_incident__incident_id
msgid "The incident case being escalated."
msgstr "Kasus insiden yang dieskalasi."

#. module: ssi_school_incident
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_incident.field_school_incident_parent_contact__incident_id
msgid "The incident case this parent contact log entry belongs to."
msgstr "Kasus insiden tempat entri log kontak orang tua ini berada."

#. module: ssi_school_incident
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_incident.field_school_incident__parent_partner_id
msgid "The parent or guardian contact to be notified about this case. Automatically defaulted from the student's Father, Mother, or Guardian contact (in that order of preference) when the Student is selected, but can still be changed manually."
msgstr "Kontak orang tua atau wali yang akan diberi tahu tentang kasus ini. Otomatis diisi default dari kontak Ayah, Ibu, atau Wali siswa (berurutan sesuai preferensi) saat Siswa dipilih, tetapi tetap dapat diubah secara manual."

#. module: ssi_school_incident
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_incident.field_school_incident_parent_contact__parent_partner_id
msgid "The parent or guardian contacted. Automatically defaulted from the incident's Parent/Guardian Contact when the Incident is selected, but can still be changed manually (e.g. when a different family member was reached)."
msgstr "Orang tua atau wali yang dihubungi. Otomatis diisi default dari Kontak Orang Tua/Wali pada insiden saat Insiden dipilih, tetapi tetap dapat diubah secara manual (mis. saat anggota keluarga lain yang berhasil dihubungi)."

#. module: ssi_school_incident
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_incident.field_school_incident__handled_by_id
msgid "The staff member responsible for handling this case (Master Log column J). Defaults to the user who logged the case."
msgstr "Staf yang bertanggung jawab menangani kasus ini (kolom J Log Induk). Default-nya pengguna yang mencatat kasus."

#. module: ssi_school_incident
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_incident.field_school_incident_parent_contact__contacted_by_id
msgid "The staff member who made this particular contact."
msgstr "Staf yang melakukan kontak ini."

#. module: ssi_school_incident
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_incident.field_school_incident__student_id
msgid "The student involved in this incident case (Master Log column B/C, the WHO element)."
msgstr "Siswa yang terlibat dalam kasus insiden ini (kolom B/C Log Induk, elemen SIAPA)."

#. module: ssi_school_incident
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_incident.field_school_academic_alert__student_id
msgid "The student whose academic standing is being evaluated."
msgstr "Siswa yang kedudukan akademiknya dievaluasi."

#. module: ssi_school_incident
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_incident.field_school_incident__enrollment_id
msgid "The student's active (open) enrollment, automatically populated when the Student is selected."
msgstr "Pendaftaran aktif (terbuka) siswa, otomatis diisi saat Siswa dipilih."

#. module: ssi_school_incident
